Original commit body from 3a0f651:

Cache the generated sketch to a .md file in the cache directory with a
filename that encodes the token budget and non-default flags:
- sketch.md (no budget)
- sketch.4000.md (4000 token budget)
- sketch.4000.notests.md (with --exclude-tests)
- sketch.4000.withsource.md (with --with-source)

The cached sketch contains only the clean markdown without the runtime
summary, making it easy to copy/paste into LLM conversations.
